      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游 unibest 元数据字段与仓库地址（docs/06 第 4.1 节：署名与来源元数据保留）",
      "content": [
        "unibest",
        "feige996",
        "yudaocode",
        "1020103647"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游署名/参考链接/issue 引用（源码注释、包元数据、LICENSE 引用）",
      "content": [
        "gitee\\.com/yudaocode/",
        "github\\.com/yudaocode/",
        "github\\.com/YunaiV/",
        "gitee\\.com/zhijiantianya/",
        "github\\.com/yudaocode$",
        "static\\.iocoder\\.cn/",
        "doc\\.iocoder\\.cn",
        "www\\.iocoder\\.cn",
        "cloud\\.iocoder\\.cn",
        "iocoder\\.cn/MyBatis",
        "@iocoder\\.cn",
        "doc\\.yudao",
        " Created by 芋道源码",
        "芋道源码",
        "@芋艿",
        "芋艿（YunaiV）",
        "yuanma@zszj\\.example\\.com"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "^apps/zhongshu-miniapp/(src|env)/",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "unibest 上游模板源码的官方维护注释与上游 issue 引用（来源说明）",
      "content": [
        "unibest 官方维护",
        "github\\.com/unibest-tech/",
        "unibest 框架",
        "貌似 unibest",
        "unibest\\.tech"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "限期兼容",
      "reason": "小程序组件/样式前缀 yd-* 为登记缩写（docs/06 第 4.3 节）；撤除条件：移动端 H5/微信构建门禁（ZS-CLIENT-005）可用后按批次替换为 zszj-* 并撤销本例外",
      "content": [
        "\\byd-[a-z]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "^README.md$",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "品牌门禁说明中引用的检测模式名（反引号内为模式字面量，非残留）",
      "content": [
        "`cn.iocoder`",
        "`yudao`",
        "`youdao`",
        "`芋道`",
        "`unibest`",
        "`yd-`"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
